---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="FAQ From Homeowners - KBTony" lang="en">
	<main>
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="advice-hero">
			<div class="container">
				<span class="category">Homeowner Resources</span>
				<h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
				<p class="tagline">Answers to your most common remodeling questions</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FAQ Content -->
		<section class="section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="faq-layout">
					<div class="faq-categories">
						<h3>Categories</h3>
						<button class="category-btn active" data-category="all">All Questions</button>
						<button class="category-btn" data-category="general">General</button>
						<button class="category-btn" data-category="kitchen">Kitchen</button>
						<button class="category-btn" data-category="bathroom">Bathroom</button>
						<button class="category-btn" data-category="budget">Budget & Cost</button>
						<button class="category-btn" data-category="timeline">Timeline</button>
					</div>

					<div class="faq-content">
						<!-- General Questions -->
						<div class="faq-item" data-category="general">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>How do I get started with my remodeling project?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>Start by scheduling a free consultation with our team. We'll discuss your vision, budget, and timeline. We'll then create a detailed design plan and provide a comprehensive quote. Once approved, we'll schedule your project and assign a dedicated project manager.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="faq-item" data-category="general">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>Are you licensed and insured?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>Yes, we are fully licensed, bonded, and insured. We carry comprehensive liability insurance and workers' compensation coverage to protect both our team and your property throughout the project.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Kitchen Questions -->
						<div class="faq-item" data-category="kitchen">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>How long does a kitchen remodel take?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>A typical kitchen remodel takes 6-12 weeks from start to finish. This includes demolition, rough-in work, cabinet installation, countertops, backsplash, and final touches. The timeline can vary based on the scope of work and material availability.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="faq-item" data-category="kitchen">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>Can I use my kitchen during the remodel?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>Your kitchen will be unusable during most of the renovation. We recommend setting up a temporary kitchen in another room with a microwave, mini-fridge, and portable cooktop. We work efficiently to minimize the disruption to your daily routine.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="faq-item" data-category="kitchen">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>Should I choose custom or semi-custom cabinets?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>Semi-custom cabinets offer great value with many design options and are typically delivered in 6-8 weeks. Custom cabinets provide unlimited design flexibility but cost 20-40% more and take 10-16 weeks. We'll help you choose based on your budget, timeline, and design goals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Bathroom Questions -->
						<div class="faq-item" data-category="bathroom">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>How long does a bathroom renovation take?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>A full bathroom remodel typically takes 3-6 weeks. A simple refresh (new fixtures, paint, tile) can be done in 1-2 weeks. Master bath renovations with custom features may take 6-8 weeks.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="faq-item" data-category="bathroom">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>Is it worth converting a tub to a shower?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>Yes, especially for master bathrooms. Walk-in showers are increasingly popular and offer better accessibility. However, if it's your only bathroom, keep at least one tub in your home - it's important for resale value and families with young children.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Budget Questions -->
						<div class="faq-item" data-category="budget">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>What's the average cost of a kitchen remodel?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>Kitchen remodels range from $25,000 for a budget refresh to $75,000+ for a high-end renovation. The average mid-range remodel costs $40,000-$60,000. Cost depends on size, materials, appliances, and structural changes.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="faq-item" data-category="budget">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>Do you offer financing options?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>Yes, we partner with leading financing companies to offer flexible payment plans with competitive rates. We can help you find financing options that fit your budget and project scope.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="faq-item" data-category="budget">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>What should I budget for unexpected costs?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>We recommend setting aside 15-20% of your total budget for contingencies. Unexpected issues like hidden water damage, outdated wiring, or structural concerns can arise once walls are opened up.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Timeline Questions -->
						<div class="faq-item" data-category="timeline">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>What's the best time of year to remodel?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>Spring and fall are popular due to mild weather, but we work year-round. Winter often has more availability and potentially better pricing. Summer is convenient if you have kids home to help with temporary arrangements.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="faq-item" data-category="timeline">
							<button class="faq-question">
								<span>How far in advance should I book?</span>
								<span class="faq-icon">+</span>
							</button>
							<div class="faq-answer">
								<p>We recommend booking 2-3 months in advance for best availability. Design and material selection can take 4-6 weeks, and popular times (spring/summer) book up quickly. However, we often have openings for urgent projects.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- CTA -->
						<div class="faq-cta">
							<h3>Still Have Questions?</h3>
							<p>Our team is here to help! Contact us for personalized answers to your remodeling questions.</p>
							<a href="/en#contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Contact Us Today</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<script>
	// FAQ Accordion functionality
	document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(button => {
		button.addEventListener('click', () => {
			const faqItem = button.parentElement;
			const isActive = faqItem.classList.contains('active');
			
			// Close all other FAQs
			document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(item => {
				item.classList.remove('active');
			});
			
			// Toggle current FAQ
			if (!isActive) {
				faqItem.classList.add('active');
			}
		});
	});

	// Category filtering
	document.querySelectorAll('.category-btn').forEach(btn => {
		btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
			const category = btn.dataset.category;
			
			// Update active button
			document.querySelectorAll('.category-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
			btn.classList.add('active');
			
			// Filter FAQs
			document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(item => {
				if (category === 'all' || item.dataset.category === category) {
					item.style.display = 'block';
				} else {
					item.style.display = 'none';
				}
			});
		});
	});
</script>

<style>
	.advice-hero {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, #001a3d 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.category {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
	}

	.advice-hero h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin: 1rem 0;
	}

	.tagline {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	.faq-layout {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
		gap: var(--spacing-xl);
		margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
	}

	.faq-categories {
		position: sticky;
		top: 100px;
		height: fit-content;
	}

	.faq-categories h3 {
		color: var(--color-primary);
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.category-btn {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		text-align: left;
		padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
		background: transparent;
		border: none;
		border-left: 3px solid transparent;
		color: var(--color-text-main);
		font-weight: 500;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
	}

	.category-btn:hover, .category-btn.active {
		border-left-color: var(--color-accent);
		background-color: var(--color-surface);
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.faq-content {
		max-width: 800px;
	}

	.faq-item {
		background: white;
		border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.faq-question {
		width: 100%;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		padding: var(--spacing-md);
		background: transparent;
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		text-align: left;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-primary);
		transition: background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.faq-question:hover {
		background: var(--color-surface);
	}

	.faq-icon {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 300;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		transition: transform 0.3s ease;
	}

	.faq-item.active .faq-icon {
		transform: rotate(45deg);
	}

	.faq-answer {
		max-height: 0;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease;
		padding: 0 var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.faq-item.active .faq-answer {
		max-height: 500px;
		padding: 0 var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.faq-answer p {
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: #555;
	}

	.faq-cta {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, #001a3d 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: var(--spacing-xl);
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
	}

	.faq-cta h3 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
	}

	.faq-cta p {
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.btn-large {
		padding: 1.2rem 3rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.faq-layout {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.faq-categories {
			position: static;
			display: flex;
			gap: 0.5rem;
			overflow-x: auto;
		}

		.faq-categories h3 {
			display: none;
		}

		.category-btn {
			white-space: nowrap;
			border-left: none;
			border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
		}

		.category-btn:hover, .category-btn.active {
			border-left: none;
			border-bottom-color: var(--color-accent);
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.advice-hero h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.faq-question {
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
